    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grow your caravan, change the world.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a convoy of elephants as they navigate an unforgiving world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate new maps for unique play-through sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with cities and help them grow to be wealthy trade hubs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off ambushes from bandit gangs and conquer their camps to make trade routes more prosperous.</p></li></ul>",
